<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="h">JAS - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">JAS - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">JAS - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">JAS - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">JAS - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Itek ire bǝn Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Igen ayou Arik bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi, igar bǝn aŋa amɛ wur ane ya ne igɔŋmimi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Itek<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itsar bǝn ten</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Izhin bǝ baŋ itsar yiŋɛ amunya ndi a ten zhin ne yi ai ki nyɛr, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />te zhin ne zhi te tsar tanyɛme min igli vuŋ kpa gli nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Ivuŋ kpa iduŋ zhin klik te na shaga, ba zhin tei wɔb ikinuŋ lankane ba. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Inuŋ ne miŋ min bate yi Mgbemgbeb ba, abɛ ben Arik, waŋ ndi anǝk kɔte ŋɔwa susun zhin yaŋ tɔ la lɛ, iwa atei nǝgu. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ama ate ben abɛ tanyɛme ne susun maa, te waŋ ndi aben yaŋ tanyɛme ne susun maa ayi ndi aŋkun nek ŋgɔŋ, ndi ŋguŋgu fuk te kɔmɔ amɔ te na ŋur kam. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Iner waŋa ba tei yik ikinuŋ ben Arik ba, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />ai ner ne yi ne asusun ayaa,ba kli amkpa zhin ne iki na maa ba.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Izumɔr waŋ ndi azǝ tu azhɔk bɛ ŋur asa ne ŋgon keŋ ndi ne nǝgu ne kɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Neme iwaŋ ndi ayi ne adudun ki abɛ ŋur asa ne yaŋ ŋgɔŋ maa, te atei zu ndi idɔ kuŋkun. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Tǝ arik aru te wu te duŋ agbar kuŋkuno, ben idɔ maa izu hrie te naŋ dɔ. Neme, iner ne yi ne adudun ki atei zhaku ne wɔb adudun ki amaa.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Anu adidik ayi bǝn waŋ ndi avuŋ kpa agli ne tsar iyah, ndi ate kli mgbamgbaŋ ne tsar iyah, atei ta itu anku keŋ ndi Arik ne na kɛ aŋyak abaŋ ndi mtanyeme bǝn abɔu.<verse eid="JAS 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Teyi ndi te ten zhin, kǝr nuŋ bɛ di, &lt;&lt;Arik a ten me ba.&gt;&gt; Tǝ ba ten Arik ne iki mimin ka, ba na ten nuŋ ba, <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />ama kɔte ŋɔwa atenu ne iki yi tik ayi maa, te vuŋu gli te na kpau. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Itik ayi mi te ŋgon, igli zumimin nyɛmɛ, zumimin te ŋgɔŋ igli iku nyɛmɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Amunya, kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ alɔm zhin ba. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />kɔte iki didik ben iki yi rɛ ire shu, ire ben Tetɛɛ ne gbarshu waŋ ndi ne na arik, ihwa ben cinces, waŋ ndi ba asen ndi izhu ba. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Nǝ te Arik te bɛ nek ta ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu ne lɛ didik maa, te ta bǝ yi abɛ kuti ne ikiki yi na maa.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwɔ te na ndum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Amunya, ijin bǝ vuŋ lɛ kǝŋe gli: kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ wɔ lɛ andanda, te zǝǝ ne lɛ te na yaŋ te mfu andanda, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />te mfu kɛ ineshir ba duŋ neshir atsǝn tsetser ndi Arik mtanyeme ba. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Neme, izhin bǝ duŋ na la lɛ mimin ben zumimin te zi zhin tu zhɔk te zǝ zhin lɛ keŋ ndi ne tib kɛ aŋyak ne asusun amin, ndi tei ta zhin zhɔk.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Kǝr zhin bǝ wɔ lɛ ankyak ba, tena lum zhin atu amin. Na zhin iki yiŋ ndi ne bla ma. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Iwaŋ ndi awɔ lɛ te ba na iki yiŋ ndi ne blai ba ayi ndi atɔ iti maa ne malibi <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />fe, ndi ne tɔ tu maa, te kama atibe andanda atei ŋur asuk ir keŋ ndi wa yime. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ama iner waŋ ndi anǝk tu maa ne tɔ cɛr te zǝ lɛ keŋ ndi itei duŋu ayi sha, te nak na amɛ, te yaŋ ŋursuk ne lɛ keŋ ndi ne wɔ kɛ, ama ai ki yiŋ ndi ne wɔi atei nugu anu didik ne iki yiŋ ndi ne nai.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Atei yi ndi nuŋ ayik tu maa te wa ayi ne zǝ ankɔŋ ayou Arik te ba vuŋ anu ba, alɔm tu maa izi ankɔŋ aye Arik maa ai iki sha. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi Arik Tetɛɛ mɔr ne tanyɛme ne wu ane yi tsetser bǝn adidik awa ai, bǝ lɔk amunkur ben amba kɔ ne iyah men te na vuŋ akpa agli ne iki yi tik ayi iyi gɔŋmimi.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Igbaŋ atɔŋ ne atu ye sɔŋ kaŋkaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Amunya, ndi abɛ zi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi ne ŋgon maa, kǝr izhin bǝ tsar sɔŋ kaŋkaŋ ka. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Te yi ndi ner nuŋ ne nyɛ amkpa ne biŋ atu amin te su ivǝn ankawun yi rɛ ŋgon ben ikluklu didik, inǝ su akpok aki ne yik iyah te na nyɛ mayi. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Izhin te kam tɔ ne su iki didik waŋa te di, &lt;&lt;Tɔ iki sɔŋ didik yiŋ ne nyagu ne yi,&gt;&gt; ama te di ne yik iyah waŋa, &lt;&lt;kli adidik amɔ&gt;&gt; kɔ &lt;&lt;zi sɔŋ ne mimi ne aza muŋ,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />izhin ne tsar yaŋ tanyɛme ne akpa te akpa ambuk ne asusun mimin.<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Wɔ zhin amunya: Arik ne hria abɛ yik iyah ne ayi aneshir abɛ gɔŋmimi te bɛ yi abɛ adudunki ne tanyɛme ne asusun te bǝ yir kɔb keŋ ndi ne me kɛ aŋyak abɛ tanyɛme ben bɔu. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ama izhin ne yik ne iyah yaŋ shak ayi. Aba abɛ yi ne adudun ki ba sak zhin iyah. Tena Gli zhin te gar amkpa ane te ambuk kai? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Aba na cɔk isak kɛ Arik awaŋ ndi izhin zeu ala.<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Atei yi ndi izhin zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik ndi ne cɛr kɛ,&lt;&lt;izhin bǝ tanyɛme ben akpa min ndi atu amin,&gt;&gt; izhin te na amɛ izhin ne na anenen. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ama izhin tsar tanyɛme ne atu amin ankyak, izhin ne la lɛ te ne yi abɛ yaŋ zǝ cɛr yi Musa. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Neme inuŋ atei di wa azǝ cɛr iyi Musa te ate kluk izhin ne kluk yi bɔbɔk. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;kǝr izhin bǝ zǝ amba ben alulum ba,te na di, &lt;&lt;kǝr abɛ ŋun neshir ba.&gt;&gt; Atei yi ndi bau ne zǝ amba ba ama une ŋun neshir une kluk zǝ cɛr iyi Musa. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Izhin bǝ lɛ te na iki yiŋ ndi ne blai ndi abaŋ me ndi atei te ba ambuk te duŋ neshir ayi sha, <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />te Arik atei te ambuk yaŋ lɔ susun ben iwaŋ ndi ba lɔ susun ba. Ilɔ susun ne te ambuk ba yime ba!<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itanyɛme bǝn na ndum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Anii ai iki didik, amunya, te neshir te tanyɛme ne susun maa te ba na ikinuŋ ka? Itanyɛme yiŋɛ ba te tau zhɔk ba. <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Ate yi ndi izumɔr kɔ iva mɔr ba yi ne iki yi su ba ben iki li ba. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Tǝ inuŋ ne miŋ min adi, &lt;&lt;tsin kɔmɔ, ubǝ yir kɔb keke, Arik abɛ nugu iki li ben iki su,&gt;&gt; te ba ne na ikinuŋ ne atu ayi iyah maa ba, ba rɛ amɛ ba. <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Amɛ itanyɛme ne susun te yaŋ na ndum, ai ki sha.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Fe anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;une tanyɛme ne susun, nga me na ndum.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 2:18">Tsar me tanyɛme imi yaŋ na ndum, nga M tei tsa ru ta yimɛ ne susun muŋ ne na ndum. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Izhin ne tanyɛme te di Arik ayi zhiin. Ne remɛ! kɔ anerim menyi ne tanyɛme amɛ ne rǝ kpa.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Uwa ne yi bliblik, itanyɛme ne susun yaŋ na ndum ai iki sha. <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Ibrai waŋ ndi ayi tsǝntsem amɔr ne baŋu ai ner ne yi tsetser ndi ne baŋ vǝvǝn amaa Ishaku anǝk Arik. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Izhin ne yik itanyɛme iyi susun maa ben iki na maa ne tsik biŋ, te itanyɛme maa ne shaga ne na ndum maa. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Neme icɛre ne shaga ndi ne di, &lt;&lt;Ibrai ne tanyɛme ben Arik, ne duŋ adiu te ai nɛr ne yi tsetser,&gt;&gt; ne na zhɔu te kpa maa Arik. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Izhin yik Arik ata neshir ne ki na maa ba ne tanyɛme ne susun maa ankyak ba.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Neme, Rahab ndi ne yi ne zǝ alulum ne yigu ai tsetser ne iki yiŋ ndi ne nai ndi ne ta abɛ nyɛ ŋɔk ntun yi Jerikɔ tɔ te na su ba ayir te duŋ ba zǝ ankɔŋ Anuŋ akɔmɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Indi ikpa keŋ ndi ba yi izhu ba ai ikum, neme tanyɛme ne susun yaŋ na ndum uyi ndi ikum.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Vuŋ anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Kǝr anuŋ ne miŋ min abɛ di aba atei yi abɛ tsar ba, amunya, te izhin ne zhi taba ndi tsara atei tǝ ta ŋas ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Bɔbɔk mɔrɔ ta tar aza ne ŋkuŋkɔŋ tetɛk. Ate yi ndi inuŋ bane lalɛ ne lɛkǝ lɛ maa ba, inere ne shaga, ne gli kpa maa anenen. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Ate yi ndi tate kpa ane ŋa ata bǝrbǝr nenu te duŋ ba azǝ ta,ta tei kam ŋama. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />kɔ tabǝ tɔ igu ŋgɔŋ. Ta ne zhi te imwe ŋgɔŋ te ŋguŋgu ŋgɔŋ fuk kɛ, ampǝm agli kɛ te gar amkpa waŋ ndi iner ne dene ate kam kɛ igara. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Iyeme ne lǝlɛn iyi gab kpa yi neshir, ama iŋur asa ŋgɔŋ. Tɔ zhin ndi agɔŋ ituk ŋgɔŋ ne ŋkliŋkla lu. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Neme, Ilǝlɛn neyi maa ai lu, iyi goŋ mimi kɛ ki mimin ne min kɛ gab kpa kɛ neshir. Icɔk ner la, iduŋ tsǝn kɛ neshir akɔte yir lu, ilǝlɛn tu maa itei goŋ ne kɔb lu.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Inarum nkaŋkaŋ,aŋliŋlɔ,inarum abɛ gbur ne mimi ben iyi kur ne amashir nek ŋgɔŋ neshir ai ten ba vu, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />ama neshir bai vuŋ lǝlɛn ayir ba. Iyi ndi itus, lǝlɛne igli lǝlɛ mimin tetɛk rumɔ.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Nǝ lǝlɛne ta gbar Ŋgɔŋ amɔr ben Tetɛɛ sak, ana yikɛ ta te aner anumɔ, abaŋ ndi Arik ne naa ba ndi iri maa. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Aye anu azhin akǝŋɛ agbar tena tenu ne kǝme. Amunya, iyiŋɛ bane te ba. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ka amashir ane men ben ane mmaŋ ai gbub nǝ ngyak tuk zhin ǝ? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Amunya, itiŋ bwab igli dɔ zetun rumɔi, ka idɔ aŋlɔŋ igli dɔ kpanduŋ rumɔ ni?<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgbemgbeb ntǝk yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ŋɔwa ne miŋ mine ayi Mgbemgbeb tena yi ne zhi ki? Duŋɔ abɛ tsar izhi maa te na ki didik ne tsǝn maa, izitu maa ire Mgbemgbeb. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Fena izhin te duŋ ilɛ mgbamgbar ben ankiŋki ben nyer tu iyi ne asusun amin, duŋ ŋur asa ma neyi ba kɔ ka ubǝ kyak ilɛ didik ba. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Ir kǝŋe &lt;&lt;Mgbemgbeb&gt;&gt; ba nyɛ rɛ shu ba iyi kɛ goŋ mimi, bai kɛ izhu tsetser ba, ai kɛ ishetan. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ndi izhin te yine ankiŋki tena yi abɛ nyɛr atu amin ankyak, amɔ wa izhin tei yik isɔŋ kɛ yaŋ rɛ tena wɔb na ki mimin. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Fena Mgbemgbeb keŋ ndi ire shu iyi tsetser; fe isik kɛ ta nyɛmɛ, iyik didik, inǝk tu, iwɔ lɔ susun ŋgɔŋ ben na kiki yi ire tɔ, iduŋ nyɛr tu te bla zub. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Abɛ wɔb sɔŋ kɛ sik abaŋ ndi atib sɔŋ kɛ sik te sɛr ki didik.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Nǝk zhin Arik atu amin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Aye nii gli mgbu bǝn ivǝ ne akpa amini? Ndika irurɛ ne kiki ndi izhin ndi te duŋ zhin tsik mgbu ne akpa amin o? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Izhin wɔb ikinuŋ ba zhin yigǝ ba. Izhin ŋun te kyerǝ ta, ndi amɛ ba zhin tei yik ki yiŋ ndi ba zhin ne wɔ bǝ ba, te ba zhin ne ben Arik ba. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Izhin ne ben, ba zhin yik ba, te izhin ben ne susun ayaa, te izhin bǝ ta kime ŋlɔk ne ki yi sha.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Ijineba aneshir abɛ zǝ shetan, ba zhin ne zhi te ivuŋ kpa biŋ kiki yi gɔŋ mimi iyi kiki kyak Arik ka? Iner waŋ ndi ate hria vuŋ kpa ben ki gɔŋ mimi atei yi ne kyak yi kɛ Arik. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Ka izhin yik ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik di ne yaŋ mgbɛb lɛ te izhu ndi ne duŋu asɔŋ ne miŋ mɔr ilɛn susun ŋgɔŋ? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Fena Arik ne nǝk ta na didik tetɛk. Waŋa ai kime ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">&lt;&lt;Arik ankyak ane lɛk tu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">Fe anǝk ina didik netu ine zi tu&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Ndi izhin te nek atu amin, ben Arik. Tsaŋ zhin ne njunju, ai klu anaŋa dɔ bene bɛ zhin.<verse eid="JAS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Tǝ zhin gbahir ben Arik atei na te gbahir bǝn abɛ zhin. Ŋla zhin aŋɔk amin, izhin abɛ lalɛ, tena ŋla zhin asusun amin, izhineba abɛ tik ayi abɛ yi asusun ayaa. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />kɔrzhin asusun ,kpaati, te zhin. Sen mlak min kam nyak izhin tena duŋ nyɛr min bǝ yi lɛn susun. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Zi atu amin zhɔk ne ti kɛ Ŋgɔŋ, fe atei lɛk zhin ne shu. <verse eid="JAS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Amunya, duŋ ter zhin akpa amin ba. Iwaŋ ndi ate ter zumen kai di wa teu ŋas ne glak cɛr Musa te ŋas. Ate yi ndi izhin te cɛr yi Musa ŋas, ba zhin zǝ anenen ba. Fe izhin ne yuŋ sɔŋ netu ŋas. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Arik wa ankyak anǝk nkanlɛ yi cɛr ben ŋas, iwaŋ ndi wa ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ta zhɔk tena zǝr. Fena izhineba ane ŋɔwa te zhin te kpamin ŋas?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋur asa ne amblɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Azizaŋa wɔ zhin, izhineba abɛ di, &lt;&lt;Aliŋ ka amblɛ ta tei gar na iyiŋ kɔ ntun yuŋ, te kɔte klɛ ise amɔ,te wɔb ki na te nyak azɔb.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Anii, ba zhin ne lu zhi iki ndi itei lu na amblɛ ba. Isɔŋ min iyi kɛ anii? Izhin yi mgbumgbuk ndi munru wanyaŋ tena naŋ dɔ. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Ndi amɛ, izhin ibǝ di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ ate yigǝ ne teu, ta tei sɔŋ tena di tei na iyiŋ kɔ iyuŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ndi yime, izhin ŋur asa tena wun shak. Ŋur asa bɔbɔk yiŋɛ iyi zumimin. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Ate yi ndi inuŋ, waŋ ndi ne zhi ki didik iyi na te ne kyak nai ma, ai lalɛ.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Ne gbaŋ abɛ yi ne adudunki atɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Wɔ zhin, izhineba ba abɛ yi ne adudunki izhin bǝ wɔ, izhin bǝ zhin te na ŋur ruru te iyah itei vuŋ zhin. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Adudunki amin ne bɔ, aputuk atei lii. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Zinariya ben Azurfa min ne bla, ibla mǝne itei tsar ki na min, itei li kpa min klɛ ndi lu. Izhin ne biŋ adudunki nyak atu amin ne kpaŋ kɛ klɛ tu. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Izhin ne kyak ya idǝk kɛ abaŋ ndi ne nazhin ndum ndi zhin ne kyak ya ba ne gli zhin te gar amkpa ane te ambuk. Izhin iyi abɛ na zhin ndum gar ben Arik. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Izhin ne sɔŋ ne gɔŋmimi kǝŋe ne wɔ men. Izhin ne li te sɔ kiki min, izhin ne yɔk atu min ankyak, izhin te angɔŋgɔŋ ndi inarum ŋub bɛr yak. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Izhin ne te abɛ yaŋ lalɛ ambuk te ŋlɔk ba, ba ne na zhin ki mimin ba.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vuŋ susun ne min kɛ yik ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Ne me, izhin bɛ vuŋ zhin asusun, amunya te ŋub iber yi nyɛ Arik. Izhin bǝ tɔ ir keŋ ndi iner ne lɔn avuŋ susun te asɔŋ aŋub iki yiŋ ndi ne ti bǝ te sɛr. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Izhineba ba minyi, izhin bǝ vuŋ asusun te kli gbamgbaŋ te nyɛ Arik ne te gbahir. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Kǝr izhin bǝ wɔb akpa ne kla ba, amunya, te kǝr abɛ te zhin ambuk ba. Ine te ambuk aklɛ kli ne anɔkɔŋ!<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Amunya, izhin bɛ tɔ ir keŋ ndi abɛ bla lɛ kɛ Arik ne vuŋ susun ne sak kɛ Arik. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Ndi zhin ne zhi, te di izhin yi abɛ nek anu adidik ne vuŋ susun min. Izhin ne wɔ ir keŋ ndi Ayuba ne vuŋ susun agli gbamgbaŋ, tei na wɔ ir keŋ ndi Arik ne nǝgu ikiki didik tetɛk ne klɛ tu, Arik alɔ susun tei na vuŋ susun.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Ankyak bɔbɔk, amunzumɔr bǝn amunvamɔr, kǝr izhin bɛ she arim ne gbarshu bǝn mimi ba kɔte ikinuŋ. Ikiyiŋ ndi izhin te nak di yi ankyak, iyi amɛ kɔ ba yi amɛ ba. Ikinuŋ te kama amɛ Arik atei te zhin ambuk.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iben Arik ne tanyɛme ne susun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Te yi ndi inuŋ ne miŋ min ayik ya, abɛ ben Arik. Inuŋ ate yik iki didik yi nyɛr, abɛ duk asem te gbara Arik asak. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Inuŋ te lɔ, abɛ zhɔ angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ akabaŋkɔŋ te bɛ benu Arik te shuru anyɛ ne tu ne sak kɛ Arik. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Iben Arik ne ita nyɛmɛ ne susun itei duŋ ner ne lɔ are; ŋgon ate duŋ ba lu akli te yi ndi ne na zumimin, atei zu gu azhɔk. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Ne me, izhin bǝ bla akpamin zumimin min te ben zhin akpa Arik atei duŋ zhin rɛ. Iben Arik iyi iner ne yi tsetser ne mgbyamgbyaŋ te na ndum.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Iliya ne yi neshir ndi mɔr. Ne ben Arik ne susun zhin te kǝr alu abɛ kuh ba, alu bane kuh ba har asi tar ne nki. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Ne na ben Arik te alu abɛ kuh, alu ne kuh, kɔte ŋɔwa ne sǝr ikpu maa.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Amunya, te yi ndi inuŋ te lalɛ mimin inuŋ abɛ gliu akama nyak ankɔŋɔ, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />bɛ zhi te waŋ ndi te Gli ne na lalɛ mimin aŋyak ankɔŋɔ ne tau azhɔk ne kuh, ina amɛ itei ta aneshir tetɛk shur ne lalɛ mimin men.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>